# Frontend (Vite) — copy to `.env.local` or `.env.development.local` and adjust.
# Restart the dev server after changing any VITE_* variable (`npm run dev`).

# Admin UI gate: comma-separated emails, matched case-insensitively to the signed-in user.
# Example with multiple admins:
# VITE_ADMIN_EMAILS=admin1@example.com,admin2@example.com
VITE_ADMIN_EMAILS=youradmin@email.com

# --- Supabase (not read by Vite): Edge Functions such as purchase-shipping-label ---
# In the Supabase Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets, set for the same admins:
#   ADMIN_EMAILS=admin@storkbin.com,other-admin@example.com
# If ADMIN_EMAILS is missing or omits your login email, the admin UI still works but
# "Create carrier label" returns 403 Admin access required.
